# Secrets — never commit
.env

# Local data, cached market history, trained models.
# The leading slash anchors this to the repository root. Without it the pattern
# also matches `mfie/data/` — the entire ingestion package — which is exactly
# what happened on the first commit here.
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.pkl

